{
 "id": 1,
 "name": "Overpass",
 "about": "A broken flyover in a drowned city at dusk in the rain, 64 by 44 m, mirrored between red (-x) and blue (+x). The flyover (y 5) runs north to south over the middle, the sniper on it among a jackknifed lorry's containers, its ends fallen away; the rocket under it among its piers. A slip road comes down from it each way on each side, on a bank at its foot and on legs at its head, so you can pass under it to the alleys behind: the overshield in the north one, the camo in the south. A parking block at each end, spawns on its roof, a ramp down its front and stairs inside. Wrecks and barriers on the road.",
